export const tagsPrintScript = (u: (p: string) => string, j: (v: unknown) => string, h: (v: unknown) => string, a: Record<string, unknown> = {}, x: string[] = []): string => `<script>
${x[0]}

// ---- Optional Local Print Service integration ----
// Shown automatically if the local helper is detected reachable on this computer right now
// (see includes/header.php for the "Install Printing Services" prompt when it's not). No
// pairing/token step is needed -- installing and running the helper is enough. Anything else
// silently falls back to the normal browser Print button above, exactly as before this feature
// existed.
(function () {
  const BASE = 'http://127.0.0.1:9294';
  fetch(BASE + '/printers')
    .then(r => r.ok ? r.json() : Promise.reject())
    .then(data => {
      if (!data.success || !data.printers || !data.printers.length) return;
      const sel = document.getElementById('localPrintPrinter');
      data.printers.forEach(function (name) {
        const opt = document.createElement('option');
        opt.value = name; opt.textContent = name;
        if (name === data.defaultPrinter) opt.selected = true;
        sel.appendChild(opt);
      });
      document.getElementById('localPrintWrap').style.display = '';
    })
    .catch(function () { /* service not running on this computer -- normal Print button stays the only option */ });

  document.getElementById('localPrintBtn')?.addEventListener('click', function () {
    const btn = this;
    btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = 'Printing…';
    fetch(BASE + '/print', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({ html: '<!DOCTYPE html>\\n' + document.documentElement.outerHTML, printerName: document.getElementById('localPrintPrinter').value, copies: 1 }),
    })
      .then(r => r.json())
      .then(function (result) {
        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = 'Print via Local Service';
        if (!result.success) alert('Print failed: ' + (result.message || result.error));
      })
      .catch(function () {
        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = 'Print via Local Service';
        alert('Could not reach the Local Print Service. Falling back to the regular Print button.');
      });
  });
})();
</script>`;

export const tagsAutoPrintJs = `
// Auto-triggered right after order creation. QR/barcode above are now plain, locally-generated
// SVG embedded directly in this HTML response — there is no client-side rendering step left to
// wait for, so this fires immediately rather than after a rendering delay.
window.addEventListener('load', function () {
  setTimeout(function () { window.print(); }, 100);
});
`;
